<p><small>[00:30]</small> <span data-speaker="Speaker 1"><span data-cue-start="30.42" data-cue-end="31.06">Good</span> <span data-cue-start="60.98" data-cue-end="61.62">morning,</span> </span><span data-speaker="Speaker 2"><span data-cue-start="61.94" data-cue-end="62.30">everyone.</span> <span data-cue-start="62.88" data-cue-end="63.08">I</span> <span data-cue-start="63.08" data-cue-end="63.32">hope</span> <span data-cue-start="63.32" data-cue-end="63.58">you're</span> <span data-cue-start="63.58" data-cue-end="63.74">all</span> <span data-cue-start="63.74" data-cue-end="64.06">feeling</span> <span data-cue-start="64.06" data-cue-end="64.58">okay</span> <span data-cue-start="64.58" data-cue-end="64.94">after</span> <span data-cue-start="64.94" data-cue-end="65.12">the</span> <span data-cue-start="65.12" data-cue-end="65.74">activities</span> <span data-cue-start="65.74" data-cue-end="65.98">of</span> <span data-cue-start="65.98" data-cue-end="66.12">the</span> <span data-cue-start="66.12" data-cue-end="66.42">last</span> <span data-cue-start="66.42" data-cue-end="66.76">week</span> <span data-cue-start="66.76" data-cue-end="66.94">or</span> <span data-cue-start="66.94" data-cue-end="67.32">so.</span></span></p>
<p><small>[01:07]</small> <span data-speaker="Speaker 2"><span data-cue-start="67.78" data-cue-end="68.22">I</span> <span data-cue-start="68.22" data-cue-end="68.48">know</span> <span data-cue-start="68.48" data-cue-end="68.80">you've</span> <span data-cue-start="68.80" data-cue-end="68.98">all</span> <span data-cue-start="68.98" data-cue-end="69.16">been</span> <span data-cue-start="69.16" data-cue-end="69.54">working</span> <span data-cue-start="69.54" data-cue-end="69.98">very</span> <span data-cue-start="69.98" data-cue-end="70.38">hard</span> <span data-cue-start="70.38" data-cue-end="70.92">recently</span> <span data-cue-start="70.92" data-cue-end="71.44">and</span> <span data-cue-start="71.44" data-cue-end="71.70">we've</span> <span data-cue-start="71.70" data-cue-end="71.90">been</span> <span data-cue-start="71.90" data-cue-end="72.76">exceptionally</span> <span data-cue-start="72.76" data-cue-end="73.32">busy,</span> <span data-cue-start="73.78" data-cue-end="74.20">especially</span> <span data-cue-start="74.20" data-cue-end="74.74">with</span> <span data-cue-start="74.74" data-cue-end="74.90">the</span> <span data-cue-start="74.90" data-cue-end="75.14">wedding</span> <span data-cue-start="75.14" data-cue-end="75.60">last</span> <span data-cue-start="75.60" data-cue-end="76.16">weekend</span> <span data-cue-start="76.16" data-cue-end="77.00">and</span> <span data-cue-start="77.00" data-cue-end="77.20">the</span> <span data-cue-start="77.20" data-cue-end="77.48">trade</span> <span data-cue-start="77.48" data-cue-end="77.80">fair</span> <span data-cue-start="77.80" data-cue-end="78.24">straight</span> <span data-cue-start="78.24" data-cue-end="78.62">after</span> <span data-cue-start="78.62" data-cue-end="79.12">that.</span> <span data-cue-start="79.72" data-cue-end="79.92">And</span> <span data-cue-start="79.92" data-cue-end="80.30">now</span> <span data-cue-start="80.30" data-cue-end="80.74">we</span> <span data-cue-start="80.74" data-cue-end="80.98">have</