</span> <span data-cue-start="94.55" data-cue-end="94.77">to</span> <span data-cue-start="94.77" data-cue-end="94.97">keep</span> <span data-cue-start="94.97" data-cue-end="95.15">it</span> <span data-cue-start="95.15" data-cue-end="95.43">up.</span></span></p>
<p><small>[01:35]</small> <span data-speaker="Speaker 2"><span data-cue-start="95.77" data-cue-end="96.29">At</span> <span data-cue-start="96.29" data-cue-end="96.47">the</span> <span data-cue-start="96.47" data-cue-end="96.79">moment,</span> <span data-cue-start="97.03" data-cue-end="97.17">we</span> <span data-cue-start="97.17" data-cue-end="97.41">don't</span> <span data-cue-start="97.41" data-cue-end="97.65">have</span> <span data-cue-start="97.65" data-cue-end="98.13">exact</span> <span data-cue-start="98.13" data-cue-end="98.47">numbers</span> <span data-cue-start="98.47" data-cue-end="98.79">of</span> <span data-cue-start="98.79" data-cue-end="99.21">guests,</span> <span data-cue-start="99.75" data-cue-end="99.93">and</span> <span data-cue-start="99.93" data-cue-end="100.13">though</span> <span data-cue-start="100.13" data-cue-end="100.35">we</span> <span data-cue-start="100.35" data-cue-end="100.77">usually</span> <span data-cue-start="100.77" data-cue-end="101.07">only</span> <span data-cue-start="101.07" data-cue-end="101.41">cater</span> <span data-cue-start="101.41" data-cue-end="101.73">for</span> <span data-cue-start="101.73" data-cue-end="101.97">groups</span> <span data-cue-start="101.97" data-cue-end="102.23">of</span> <span data-cue-start="102.23" data-cue-end="102.51">less</span> <span data-cue-start="102.51" data-cue-end="102.85">than</span> <span data-cue-start="102.85" data-cue-end="103.09">50,</span> <span data-cue-start="103.75" data-cue-end="104.05">we</span> <span data-cue-start="104.05" data-cue-end="104.35">will</span> <span data-cue-start="104.35" data-cue-end="104.73">have</span> <span data-cue-start="104.73" data-cue-end="105.17">quite</span> <span data-cue-start="105.17" data-cue-end="105.37">a</span> <span data-cue-start="105.37" data-cue-end="105.57">few</span> <span data-cue-start="105.57" data-cue-end="105.85">more</span> <span data-cue-start="105.85" data-cue-end="106.05">than</span> <span data-cue-start="106.05" data-cue-end="106.37">that.</span> <span data-cue-start="106.83" data-cue-end="107.31">So,</span> <span data-cue-start="107.73" data-cue-end="107.93">as</span> <span data-cue-start="107.93" data-cue-end="108.11">I</span> <span data-cue-start="108.11" data-cue-end="108.53">said,</span> <span data-cue-start="109.19" data-cue-end="109.29">not</span> <span data-cue-start="109.29" data-cue-end="109.69">sure</span> <span data-cue-start="109.69" data-cue-end="109.95">of</span> <span data-cue-start="109.95" data-cue-end="110.37">numbers,</span> <span data-cue-start="110.71" data-cue-end="111.01">but</span> <span data-cue-start="111.01" data-cue-end="111.25">of</span> <span data-cue-start="111.25" data-cue-end="111.59">course</span> <span data-cue-start="111.59" data-cue-end="111.89">we</span> <span data-cue-start="111.89" data-cue-end="112.35">won't</span> <span data-cue-start="112.35" data-cue-end="112.49">go</span> <span data-cue-start="112.49" data-cue-end="112.75">over</span> <span data-cue-start="112.75" data-cue-end="112.87">the</span> <span data-cue-start="112.87" data-cue-end="113.27">maximum</span> <span data-cue-start="113.27" data-cue-end="113.65">of</span> <span data-cue-start="113.65" data-cue-end="114.35">100.</span> <span data-cue-start="115.03" data-cue-end="115.53">But</span> <span data-cue-start="115.53" data-cue-end="115.81">it's</span> <span data-cue-start="115.81" data-cue-end="116.05">likely</span> <span data-cue-start="116.05" data-cue-end="116.41">that</span> <span data-cue-start="116.41" data-cue-end="116.63">we</span> <span data-cue-start="116.63" data-cue-end="116.91">will</span> <span data-cue-start="116.91" data-cue-end="117.17">need</span> <span data-cue-start="117.17" data-cue-end="117.51">all</span> <span data-cue-start="117.51" data-cue-end="117.67">of</span> <span data-cue-start="117.67" data-cue-end="117.81">you</span> <span data-cue-start="117.81" data-cue-end="117.97">to</span> <span data-cue-start="117.97" data-cue-end="118.19">work</span> <span data-c